! Persistent X resources - loaded once via `xrdb -merge` in .xinitrc, so
! these apply to EVERY xterm for the rest of the session (launcher-started,
! typed from another terminal, etc), not just one specific invocation.
!
! Black background instead of xterm's compiled-in white-on-black default.
! Font: "10x20" (misc-misc bitmap set) is already the LARGEST fixed-width
! bitmap font installed - nothing bigger to switch to - so this uses the
! already-installed scalable DejaVu Sans Mono (Xft/TrueType) instead.
!
! faceSize has been guessed wrong twice now (12 too big, 10 still too big -
! a plain points*dpi/72 estimate clearly isn't matching what this actually
! renders at). Use `zxfont N` (usr/sbin/zxfont) to open test xterms at a
! few sizes and see what actually looks right, rather than guess again -
! then tell me the number and this becomes the permanent default. 7 here
! now is a deliberately conservative correction, not a confirmed answer.
XTerm*background: black
XTerm*foreground: white
XTerm*faceName: DejaVu Sans Mono
XTerm*faceSize: 7
XTerm*geometry: 44x22
